  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}又来了～。\n要是有阴影，小熊的鼻子感应器\n怎么也会发现的熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}嗅嗅……闻闻……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}看吧？什么也没……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}有啊啊啊！！\n真的有不少阴影啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}等等，真的有阴影！？\n怎、怎么办？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}冷静{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}先往前走一点看看{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我会保护千枝{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}嗯……冷静，冷静……\n深呼吸……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}呼，好了。\n反正不能放着不管，\n只能进去调查一下了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}是、是啊。\n待在这里也不是办法……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}喂……！\n又、又来了，说这种话……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}我、我知道啦。\n反正不能放着不管，\n进去看看吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}那我就在这里\n为大家提供支援。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}啊？\n……那我也留下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}难道是想当我的护卫？\n明明是完二，还挺温柔嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}吵死了。\n被阴影袭击我可不管哦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}开玩笑的啦！\n那学长，我和完二在这里等着。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}不好意思，我想去调查\n这个节目以外的地方。\n也发现了一些在意的东西……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 09 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}哎？啊，这样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 03 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}那我和直斗一起去。\n这边有搭档在，\n也没什么好担心的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}小心点{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:17:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}直斗就拜托你了{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}交给我吧。\n等着我们的报告哦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}我、我没关系。\n你们也多加小心。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_021.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}那就在刚才的入口会合吧。\n别大意。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
